      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Following a right capsulo-lenticular hematoma, a 35-year-old man developed left sensory motor hemiplegia. Three years later, he still describes the existence of a supernumerary phantom limb. Mood disturbances, hypersexuality and attentional left hemineglect were also present."},
